{
  "title": "Elastic IP · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "계정에 할당해 공인 IPv4 주소로 사용하는 고정 주소다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#allocation-and-association\">Allocation and Association</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reassociation\">Reassociation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#regional-scope-and-network-border-group\">Regional Scope and Network Border Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#public-ipv4-pricing\">Public IPv4 Pricing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#elastic-ip-and-other-entry-points\">Elastic IP and Other Entry Points</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>21 / 62</span></div><h1>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 5 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>는 계정에 할당해 연결 대상을 바꿀 수 있는 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 자동 할당 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>와 달리 리소스 교체에도 같은 주소를 유지하는 용도로 사용한다.</p><p>주소만 할당받아서는 통신하지 않는다. 연결된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 구성의 Route와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> 등 인터넷 통신 조건이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"정적 주소와 실행 리소스의 분리\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>정적 주소와 실행 리소스의 분리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Assignment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></strong><small>계정에 할당한 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Association</strong><small>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>와 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client connection</strong><small>고정 주소로 접근</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Recovery</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> failure</strong><small>앱·Host 장애</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Reassociation</strong><small>지원 새 대상에 주소 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Service recovery</strong><small>데이터·앱 준비도 필요</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">EIP만 이동한다고 애플리케이션 상태와 데이터까지 이동하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"allocation-and-association\"><h2>Allocation and Association<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#allocation-and-association\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>계정에 주소를 Allocate한 뒤 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>의 Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 등에 Associate한다. 연결 해제와 주소 반환은 별개 작업이다. 반환하지 않은 주소는 계정 리소스로 남으며 과금과 Quota를 확인해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"reassociation\"><h2>Reassociation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reassociation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>장애 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에서 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>로 주소를 다시 연결해 외부 고정 주소를 유지할 수 있다. 기존 연결 세션이 그대로 살아남는다는 뜻은 아니다. 애플리케이션 복구·재시도와 전환 시간을 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-scope-and-network-border-group\"><h2>Regional Scope and Network Border Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#regional-scope-and-network-border-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 및 Network Border Group 범위 제약을 가진다. 임의의 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>로 그대로 옮길 수 없다. Local Zone 등과 연계할 때 지원되는 주소 범위를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"public-ipv4-pricing\"><h2>Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> Pricing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#public-ipv4-pricing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 제공 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>는 사용 중인지 유휴인지와 무관하게 과금될 수 있다. 고정 주소가 필요하지 않은 경우 주소 사용 수와 비용을 줄이는 구조를 검토한다. 오래된 무료 조건을 현재 기본 규칙으로 암기하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"elastic-ip-and-other-entry-points\"><h2>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> and Other Entry Points<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#elastic-ip-and-other-entry-points\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>에는 일반적으로 고정 Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>를 직접 붙이지 않는다. 고정 진입 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>가 필요하면 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> 같은 서비스가 요구에 맞는지 비교한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 이름의 안정성과 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 주소의 고정성은 다른 요구다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>외부 파트너의 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Allowlist 때문에 고정 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>가 필요하면 서비스 진입 구조와 장애 전환 범위를 먼저 정하고 Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>를 선택한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>한 서버의 고정 주소는 멀티 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 자동 장애 조치를 대신하지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/elastic-ip-addresses-eip.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/elastic-ip-addresses-eip.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q016\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q010\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q083\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet&#x27;s route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">이전 용어 <b>EFS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">다음 용어 <b>ElastiCache</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
